# Intentionally minimal. The base image shipped
#   GTK_THEME=Adwaita:dark
#   QT_STYLE_OVERRIDE=adwaita-dark
# both of which fought the HyprTomic theming pipeline:
#   * QT_STYLE_OVERRIDE overrides the qt6ct/Kvantum style selected in
#     ~/.config/qt6ct/qt6ct.conf (and adwaita-qt is not installed anyway).
#   * GTK_THEME pins the GTK theme name, which would shadow a future concrete
#     GTK theme.
# The dotfiles own the palette instead: ~/.config/gtk-{3,4}.0/gtk.css,
# qt6ct colour schemes + Kvantum, all generated by apply-theme.sh.
